        </area>
        <area aac="QLD_FA004" description="South Queensland" type="sub-region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-26T05:00:00+10:00" end-time-local="2026-10-30T00:00:00+10:00" start-time-utc="2026-10-25T19:00:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-29T14:00:00Z">
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A weakening ridge extends over the south Queensland waters. A high [1028 hPa] near New Zealand will move slowly east over the next few days. A trough will move across the southeast waters early Tuesday before pushing northward and lingering near K'gari or over the Capricornia waters until midweek.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
